OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow Subway reopens after rush
OL,4,Ahour closure due to technical issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow's Subway service has reopened
OL,7,Fafter being completely suspended for
OL,8,Fmore than two hours due to a technical
OL,9,Fissue.
OL,11,FServices on both the Inner and Outer
OL,12,Flines were halted at about 08:30, with
OL,13,Fpassengers told to leave stations and
OL,14,Ffind alternative transport.
OL,16,FStrathclyde Partnership for Transport
OL,17,F(SPT) had earler stated on social
OL,18,Fmedia: "Both Inner and Outer Circles
OL,19,Fare currently suspended due to a
OL,20,Ftechnical issue in the control room.
OL,21,F"We are working to resolve the issue
OL,22,Fand will update when services resume."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
